#: index.php:493
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Aku bakal jikok kesempatan iki nggo ngucapke matur suwun karo poro "
"penerjemah seng mungkinke Rufus, kambi halaman web iki, diterjemahke neng "
"macem-macem boso. Nek Sampeyan isoh nggunakne Rufus neng basane Sampeyan, "
"Sampeyan kudu matur suwun karo poro penerjemah!"

#: index.php:494
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Penggunaan"

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr "Unduh executable e terus jalanke iku &ndash; ora perlu di pasang."

#: index.php:496
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr ""
"Executable e wes di sign secoro digital karo tanda tangan kudu nyatakne:"

#: index.php:498
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 utowo lebih)"

#: index.php:499
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 utowo sebelume)"

#: index.php:501
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Catetan nggo dukungan DOS:"

#: index.php:502
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Nek Sampeyan nggawe drive bootable DOS gek nggunakne keyboard non-US, Rufus "
"bakal milih toto letak keyboard sesuai kambi lokasi sisteme Sampeyan."

#: index.php:503
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Catetan nggo dukungan ISO:"

#: index.php:504
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from "
"an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Kabeh versi Rufus kawet v1.1.0 mungkinke nggawe USB bootable teko <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>gambar ISO</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:505
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the "
"freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nggawe gambar ISO teko disk fisik utowo teko sak set file kui gampang, lewat "
"aplikasi pembakaran CD, koyo to <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or "
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

#: index.php:507
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Pertanyaan Seng Sering Ditekokne (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:508
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr "FAQ Rufus kesedia <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>NANG KENE</a></b>."

#: index.php:509
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nek pengen ngekei masukan, lapor bug utowo njalok peningkatan, monggo "
"gunakne GitHub  <a target=\"_blank\" %s>pelacak masalah</a>. Utowo Sampeyan "
"iso <a target=\"_blank\" %s>kirim surel</a>."

#: index.php:511
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lisensi"

#: index.php:512
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> utowo "
"lebih."

#: index.php:512
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you "
"respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan bebas nyebarke, modip, utowo malah ngedol piranti lunak iki, asalke "
"Sampeyan hormati lisensi GPLv3."

#: index.php:513
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Rufus diproduksi transparan 100%%, teko <a target=\"_blank\" %s>sumber "
"publike</a>, nggunakne lingkungan <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a>."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:515
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Catetan perubahan"

#: index.php:544
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Kode sumber"

#: index.php:546
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Sampeyan yo iso klon repositori <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> nganggo "
"perintah iki:"

#: index.php:548
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kanggo informasi luweh lengkap, tili'i <a target=\"_blank\" %s>proyek "
"GitHub</a>."

#: index.php:549
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Nek Sampeyan kui developer, Sampeyan dianjurke nggo ngutak-atek Rufus karo "
"ngirim tambalan."

#: index.php:551
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Sumbangan"

#: index.php:552
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Aku sering di tekoni perkoro sumbangan, tak tegeske neng halaman iki <b>ora</"
"b> enek tombol sumbangan."

#: index.php:553
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Alesan utamane kui korno aku ngeroso sistem donasi ora nggawe pengembangan "
"priranti lunak luweh apik utowo luweh elek, malah iso ngekei roso bersalah "
"kanggo pengguna seng ora nyumbang."

#: index.php:556
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Nek Sampeyan tetep bersikeras, Sampeyan iso nyumbang neng <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, marai dekne kui alesan "
"utomo ngopo piranti lunak koyo Rufus kui enek."

#: index.php:557
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much "
"appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Aku bakal nganggo kesempatan iki nggo ngomong <i><u>matur suwun</u></i> "
"kanggo dukungan karo antusiasme Sampeyan kambi program cilik iki: iki "
"dihargai banget!"

#: index.php:558
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Tapi monggo teros nggunakne Rufus tanpo roso salah korno &dash; ora mesti "
"kontribusi kui secoro finansial!"

#: index.php:560
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Daftar ISO seng kenek di enggo karo Rufus"

